<Base title="Work with me" active="/work/" description="Speaking, advisory, and hands-on work on data readiness and AI for water infrastructure with Hardeep Anand."><section class="page-head"><p class="kicker">Work with me</p><h1>A clearer view of<br/><em>your hardest problem.</em></h1><p class="lede">Three decades inside water infrastructure, now building the intelligence layer it was missing. Let’s put that experience to work.</p></section><section class="doors wrap"><div class="door-grid"><div class="door"><span class="door-top">01 / SPEAKING</span><h3>Ideas that<br/><em>connect.</em></h3><p>Keynotes and conversations on AI in water, data readiness, and reading infrastructure like a living system. Built for operators and decision-makers.</p></div><div class="door"><span class="door-top">02 / ADVISORY</span><h3>Experience at<br/><em>the table.</em></h3><p>Board and executive advisory on data strategy, AI readiness, and turning fragmented information into a foundation for decisions.</p></div><div class="door"><span class="door-top">03 / CONSULTING & BUILDS</span><h3>From insight<br/><em>to action.</em></h3><p>Hands-on engagements through APAS.AI. Start with the problem, connect the data, and build intelligence people can use.</p></div></div></section><section class="newsletter wrap"><div class="nl-card"><div><p class="section-label">START A CONVERSATION</p><h2>What are you<br/><em>working on?</em></h2><p>For speaking, include the date and audience. For a project, tell me the decision you need to make and what stands in the way.</p></div><div class="nl-action">{booking && <a class="btn" style="background:var(--sky);color:var(--deep);margin-bottom:16px" href={booking} target="_blank" rel="noopener">Book a conversation ↗</a>}<a class="btn" style="background:var(--sky);color:var(--deep);border:0" href="mailto:hardeep@apas.ai?subject=Let%E2%80%99s%20work%20together">Email Hardeep ↗</a><p class="nl-note">hardeep@apas.ai<br/>Or <a href="https://www.linkedin.com/in/hardeepanand/">connect on LinkedIn</a>.</p></div></div></section></Base>
